    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 82 is set within the peaceful and well-established Bloomfield Park development in the heart of Donnybrook. This attractive second floor two-bedroom apartment enjoys a convenient location just minutes from the villages of Donnybrook and Ballsbridge.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation extends to approximately 69sq.m (742sq.ft) and comprises a good entrance hallway leading to a bright spacious sitting room with access to a private balcony and an open connection to the kitchen, creating a comfortable and practical living space. There are two generous double bedrooms, one of which benefits from a newly appointed ensuite bathroom, together with a main bathroom and separate utility room. The apartment itself has been very well maintained, as have the common areas within the development which are beautifully presented throughout.\n\nThe apartment also benefits from designated parking, and the surrounding development offers a quiet and attractive setting, while remaining within easy reach of the excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities in Donnybrook and Ballsbridge. The location also provides excellent access to Dublin city centre and a host of transport links.\n\nAn ideal choice for those seeking a well-located home or investment in a peaceful residential setting, with the convenience of both Donnybrook and Ballsbridge close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 1.2m x 4.3m\nEntered through a hardwood door into a bright tiled hallway with intercom, hot press and storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.1m\nExcellent double bedroom with large window to side, built in wardrobes and door through to\n\nEn Suite Shower Room - 1.4m x 2.1m\nModern bathroom with tiled floor, tiled walls, electric towel rail, power shower with rainmaker shower head w.c., wash hand basin .\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 2.6m\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, bath with shower attachment over, w.c., wash hand basin and electric towel rail.\n\nUtility Room - 1.7m x 1.7m\nGood storage with provision for washing machine and dryer and houses the Gloworm gas boiler.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.5m x 5.4m\nWonderful bright space with window to side and private balcony to the front.\n\nKitchen - 2.6m x 1.8m\nModern high gloss kitchen with a range of eye and floor level units, integrated Neff oven, hob and extractor fan & integrated microwave.\n\nOutside - \nThe apartment is set within the attractive grounds of Bloomfield Park with well-maintained gardens and private car parking. There is also a concierge service within the development. The balcony off the living space looks over the grounds and is a lovely setting to relax.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Bright , spacious apartment extending to approx. 60sq.m (645sq.ft)</li><li>Spacious double bedrooms, one with en-suite</li><li>Modern open plan living space with access to a private balcony.</li><li>Designated secure car parking.</li><li>Gas fired central heating.</li><li>Secure development nestled within Donnybrook Village, close to all conceivable amenities.</li><li>Well maintained and attractive development throughout.</li><li>Lift access to all floors</li><li>Service charge c. 3,770</li><li>Concierge service within development.</ul>"
      },
